# Amazon Transcribe Streaming Service Client

The `aws-sdk-transcribe-streaming` package provides a client for making
requests to Amazon Transcribe Streaming Service.

> **Note:** This SDK is in Developer Preview. Breaking changes may occur prior
> to the release of version 4.0.0.

## Installation

```bash
python -m pip install aws-sdk-transcribe-streaming
```

